 {id:"skill-abstract-expression",name:"abstract-expression-video-prompter",description:"为短视频选择与情境相关的漫剧/表情包演技、弹性形变、喜剧节奏和同步音效。",source:"内置适配 · Codex Skill",instructions:`Keep the referenced character identity, clothing, camera direction, and environment stable. Build one continuous emotional arc: neutral setup -> clear trigger -> readable reaction -> exaggerated transformation -> short hold -> recovery or punchline. Choose only effects that directly fit the scene, with at most three effects in one clip. Available effect families include eye-pop shock, star or heart eyes, puffed cheeks, facial melting, brain smoke, misplaced facial features, galaxy dizziness, mouth zipper, waterfall tears, soul leaving body, stone embarrassment, toe-curling embarrassment, blooming flowers, head fire, exploding hair, stone shock, shoulder mini-characters fighting, coin eyes, drool river, eating glow, "true fragrance" reversal, speed slap, gacha frenzy, slacking guilt, stubbornness, and lemon-sour reaction. Synchronize squash-and-stretch, camera punches, freeze beats, particles, and comic sound effects. Keep it funny and expressive, never grotesque or horror.`},
 {id:"skill-brand-promo",name:"brand-promo-video-generator",description:"根据真实品牌、产品和店面素材设计清晰卖点、镜头节奏与行动号召，避免虚构宣传。",source:"内置适配 · MiniMax Skill",instructions:`Treat supplied logos, product images, screenshots, store images, and user-provided claims as authoritative. Do not invent product features, prices, guarantees, UI states, awards, or performance claims. Preserve brand marks, product shape, colors, labels, and logo clearspace. Use a product-specific story spine: recognizable opening, customer need or context, product/service evidence, payoff, and a clear call to action. Map each spoken claim to a visible supporting action or asset. Keep shots readable, commercially polished, and executable within the allotted duration. Avoid fake HUD overlays, fake interface screens, unreadable text, and decorative effects that obscure the product or CTA.`},
 {id:"skill-paper-collage",name:"paper-collage-explainer-generator",description:"把概念转成高级纸张拼贴、半色调剪纸和逐件组装的定格动画说明风格。",source:"内置适配 · MiniMax Skill",instructions:`Use premium editorial paper collage on a flat bold color field: black-and-white halftone cutouts, solid cardstock accents, cream keylines, subtle paper fiber, restrained torn edges, and small grounding shadows. Animate as tactile stop-motion assembly: paper pieces pop in, slide, bounce, press, layer, and lock into place with visible depth. Translate each idea into one clear visual metaphor and keep the layout legible. Default audio is tactile collage sound effects only—paper pops, page flips, clicks, swishes, snaps, and soft impacts. Add voiceover, subtitles, or background music only when explicitly requested. Do not fabricate UI, logos, quotations, or long unreadable text.`}
